note top of hermetic_boundary
  **Hermetic Compilation Boundary (AA-02, Sec.1.2, Sec.2.7):**
  - **Read-lock** on Directive Graph during compilation (Sec.3.4)
  - **Frozen environment**: engine version, toolchain, AI components (model/prompt/decoder hashes)
  - **Validation pipeline (order matters):**
    1. Schema Validator (JSON Schema Draft-07)
    2. AST Discriminator Validator (**normative gate**)
    3. Complexity Validator (depth <= 32, nodes <= 256, width <= 64)
    4. Lineage DAG Validator (acyclicity, depth <= 64)
    5. RE2 Canary Checker (canary vectors)
    6. Portability Validator (UTC, finite numerics, regex flags)
    7. Cross-Layer Version Checker (MAJOR must match)
    8. Dual-Hash Engine + Incremental Compiler + Snapshot Generator
  - **Output**: Immutable CG-IR snapshot + provenance
  - **Policy Runtime Prohibition**: policy_doctrine.yaml MUST NOT be read at runtime (AA-02)
end note

